{
  "archetype": "scaled_release_train",
  "display_name": "Scaled Agile Release Train",
  "family": "iterative",
  "summary": "Programme increment planning across many teams with shared cadence and dependency control.",
  "template_version": "2026.10",
  "states": [
    {
      "key": "programme_backlog",
      "name": "Programme Backlog",
      "category": "backlog",
      "initial": true,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "feature_analysis",
      "name": "Feature Analysis",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 12,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": [
        "Benefit hypothesis written",
        "WSJF score calculated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "increment_committed",
      "name": "Committed to Increment",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "feature_in_progress",
      "name": "Feature In Progress",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 10,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "system_demo",
      "name": "System Demo",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 72,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "integration_testing",
      "name": "Integration Testing",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 6,
      "sla_hours": 96,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "release_ready",
      "name": "Release Ready",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "released",
      "name": "Released",
      "category": "done",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "dependency_blocked",
      "name": "Dependency Blocked",
      "category": "blocked",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 48,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "deferred",
      "name": "Deferred",
      "category": "cancelled",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "key": "analyse",
      "name": "Analyse",
      "from": "programme_backlog",
      "to": "feature_analysis",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "commit_in_planning",
      "name": "Commit in planning",
      "from": "feature_analysis",
      "to": "increment_committed",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "wsjf_score"
        },
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "owning_team"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "start_feature",
      "name": "Start feature",
      "from": "increment_committed",
      "to": "feature_in_progress",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "wip_available"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "demo",
      "name": "Demo",
      "from": "feature_in_progress",
      "to": "system_demo",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "demo_feedback",
      "name": "Demo feedback",
      "from": "system_demo",
      "to": "feature_in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "accept_demo",
      "name": "Accept demo",
      "from": "system_demo",
      "to": "integration_testing",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "product_manager",
          "min_approvals": 1,
          "distinct_from_author": true
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "integration_failed",
      "name": "Integration failed",
      "from": "integration_testing",
      "to": "feature_in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "integration_passed",
      "name": "Integration passed",
      "from": "integration_testing",
      "to": "release_ready",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "checklist_complete",
          "checklist": "end_to_end_suite"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "release_on_demand",
      "name": "Release on demand",
      "from": "release_ready",
      "to": "released",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "release_train_engineer",
          "min_approvals": 1,
          "distinct_from_author": true
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "stamp_field",
          "field": "released_at"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "blocked_on_dependency",
      "name": "Blocked on dependency",
      "from": "feature_in_progress",
      "to": "dependency_blocked",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "dependency_owner"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "dependency_cleared",
      "name": "Dependency cleared",
      "from": "dependency_blocked",
      "to": "feature_in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "defer",
      "name": "Defer",
      "from": "programme_backlog",
      "to": "deferred",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "key": "increment_boundary_carryover",
      "event": "increment_closed",
      "condition": "item.state not in ['released', 'deferred']",
      "action": "move:programme_backlog;label:carryover",
      "description": "Returns uncompleted features for replanning.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "dependency_aging_alert",
      "event": "time_in_state_exceeded",
      "condition": "state == 'dependency_blocked' and hours_in_state > 48",
      "action": "notify:release_train_engineer;notify:dependency_owner",
      "description": "Escalates aging cross team dependencies.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "risk_roam_capture",
      "event": "field_changed",
      "condition": "label == 'risk'",
      "action": "create_record:roam_risk",
      "description": "Captures programme risks on the ROAM board.",
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "ceremonies": [
    {
      "name": "Increment planning",
      "cadence": "per_increment",
      "duration_minutes": 960,
      "participants": [
        "release_train_engineer",
        "product_manager",
        "team_lead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coordination sync",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "release_train_engineer",
        "team_lead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "System demo",
      "cadence": "biweekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "product_manager",
        "team_lead",
        "stakeholder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspect and adapt",
      "cadence": "per_increment",
      "duration_minutes": 180,
      "participants": [
        "release_train_engineer",
        "team_lead",
        "product_manager"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "roles": [
    "release_train_engineer",
    "product_manager",
    "system_architect",
    "team_lead",
    "engineer",
    "stakeholder"
  ],
  "cadence": {
    "type": "programme_increment",
    "increment_weeks": 10,
    "iteration_days": 14
  },
  "metrics": [
    "increment_predictability",
    "feature_cycle_time",
    "dependency_count",
    "release_frequency"
  ],
  "anchors": {
    "intake": "programme_backlog",
    "rework": "feature_in_progress",
    "release_transition": "release_on_demand",
    "done": "released",
    "blocked": "dependency_blocked",
    "build_states": [
      "feature_in_progress"
    ],
    "review_states": [
      "system_demo",
      "integration_testing"
    ]
  },
  "description_text": "Workflow template: Scaled Agile Release Train (scaled_release_train).\nProgramme increment planning across many teams with shared cadence and dependency control.\nStates in order: Programme Backlog, Feature Analysis, Committed to Increment, Feature In Progress, System Demo, Integration Testing, Release Ready, Released, Dependency Blocked, Deferred.\nTransition Analyse moves work from programme_backlog to feature_analysis with no guard.\nTransition Commit in planning moves work from feature_analysis to increment_committed with required field wsjf score; required field owning team.\nTransition Start feature moves work from increment_committed to feature_in_progress with wip available.\nTransition Demo moves work from feature_in_progress to system_demo with no guard.\nTransition Demo feedback moves work from system_demo to feature_in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Accept demo moves work from system_demo to integration_testing with approval by 1 product manager.\nTransition Integration failed moves work from integration_testing to feature_in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Integration passed moves work from integration_testing to release_ready with completed end to end suite checklist.\nTransition Release on demand moves work from release_ready to released with approval by 1 release train engineer.\nTransition Blocked on dependency moves work from feature_in_progress to dependency_blocked with required field dependency owner.\nTransition Dependency cleared moves work from dependency_blocked to feature_in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Defer moves work from programme_backlog to deferred with no guard.\nAutomation increment_boundary_carryover: Returns uncompleted features for replanning.\nAutomation dependency_aging_alert: Escalates aging cross team dependencies.\nAutomation risk_roam_capture: Captures programme risks on the ROAM board.\nCeremonies: Increment planning, Coordination sync, System demo, Inspect and adapt.\nPrimary metrics: increment predictability, feature cycle time, dependency count, release frequency."
}